sequenceDiagram
    participant Manager as IA Manager
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant WAL as Workpaper Authoring & Lifecycle
    participant CR as Collaboration & Review
    participant INT as Integration Layer
    participant AB as AuditBoard/APEX
    participant GAL as Governance, Audit Trail & Lineage
    participant EB as EventBridge

    Manager->>UI: Initiate Review (Assign Reviewer)
    UI->>CR: Assign Review (workpaperId, reviewer)
    CR->>EB: Emit Event (ReviewAssigned)
    EB->>GAL: Log Assignment
    Reviewer->>UI: Provide Feedback/Approve
    UI->>CR: Update Review State (e.g., Approved)
    CR->>WAL: Transition Lifecycle (to Finalized)
    WAL->>EB: Emit Event (StateChanged: Finalized)
    EB->>GAL: Log State Change
    WAL->>INT: Generate Export (PDF/Word with Hash)
    INT->>AB: Push Immutable Artifact & Structured Data (API/Event)
    AB-->>INT: Confirm Receipt
    INT->>GAL: Log Export Event with Hash
    GAL->>KDS: Append Integrity Record